SUMMARY:Handbooks & Guides
DESCRIPTION:Official Handbooks Al-Qadisiyah University publishes a set of handbooks organising academic and administrative work and clarifying rights and responsibilities for all members of the university community.\nStudent Handbook Everything a university student needs to know about:\nRegistration and academic advising The examination system, pass criteria, and promotion Student discipline and the code of conduct Co-curricular activities, libraries, and student services Grievance and complaints procedures 📄 Download Student Handbook 2024–2025 Faculty Handbook Covers:\nAcademic and research duties Scientific promotion process (Staff portal) Leave, grants, and external assignments Performance evaluation criteria 📄 Download Faculty Handbook Administrative Staff Handbook Includes:\nOrganisational structure and delegated authorities Financial and administrative regulations Leave and promotion procedures Workplace code of conduct 📄 Download Administrative Handbook Related Regulations Academic Regulations Policies &amp; Privacy Accessibility Editor note: Upload the actual PDF files to static/media/handbooks/ and update the links above.\n
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
